"section for a totally new report in the :guilabel:`Reporting` menu, you need"
" to create a new `ir.ui.menu` record (usually in the main `l10n_XX` module) "
"and a new `ir.actions.client` (usually in the new report XML file) that "
"calls the `account.report` with  the new **report id**. Then, set the new "
"menu as `parent_id` field in the action model."
msgstr ""
