#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes.rst:None
msgid "Artistic illustration of \"Web design\""
msgstr "Художествена илюстрация на „Уеб дизайн“"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes.rst:13
msgid ""
"The Odoo Website Builder is an excellent tool for creating a website fully "
"integrated with other Odoo apps. Using the theme's options and building "
"blocks is easy and allows you to personalize your web presence the way you "
"want. However, you can take things even further."
msgstr ""
"Odoo Website Builder е отличен инструмент за създаване на уебсайт, напълно "
"интегриран с останалите приложения на Odoo. Използването на опциите на "
"темата и градивните блокове е лесно и ви позволява да персонализирате онлайн"
" присъствието си по начина, по който искате. Въпреки това можете да отидете "
"и по-далеч."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes.rst:17
msgid ""
"In this documentation, you will learn to completely customize your website "
"without touching Odoo's core files, and this way, preserve the editing "
"options of the Website Builder."
msgstr ""
"В тази документация ще научите как напълно да персонализирате уебсайта си, "
"без да засягате основните файлове на Odoo, и по този начин да запазите "
"опциите за редактиране на Website Builder."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes.rst:20
msgid ""
"The information compiled in this documentation is based on our past "
"experiences - both failures and successes. We invite you to use it as a base"
" to build your own website and adapt it to your needs."
msgstr ""
"Информацията, събрана в тази документация, се основава на нашия минал опит -"
" както провали, така и успехи. Каним ви да я използвате като основа за "
"изграждане на собствен уебсайт и да я адаптирате според нуждите си."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:3
#: ../../docs/content/developer/tutorials/website_theme/04_customisation_part2.rst:138
msgid "Animations"
msgstr "Анимации"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo uses eye-catching animations that can bring your website to life. By "
"default, we can use three kinds of animations:"
msgstr ""
"Odoo използва привличащи вниманието анимации, които могат да съживят "
"уебсайта ви. По подразбиране можем да използваме три вида анимации:"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:8
msgid "Animations on appearance"
msgstr "Анимации при поява"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:9
msgid "Animations on scroll"
msgstr "Анимации при скролиране"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:10
msgid "Animations on hover"
msgstr "Анимации при задържане на курсора (hover)"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:15
msgid "On appearance"
msgstr "При поява"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:17
msgid ""
"In standard, you can add animations to column, text and image elements when "
"they appear, thanks to the Website Builder. Odoo detects when your element "
"is in the viewport and launches the animation. A large selection of "
"animations is available:"
msgstr ""
"В стандартния вариант можете да добавяте анимации към елементи от тип "
"колона, текст и изображение при появата им, благодарение на Website Builder."
" Odoo открива кога елементът ви е във видимата зона (viewport) и стартира "
"анимацията. Налична е голяма селекция от анимации:"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:21
msgid "Fade in"
msgstr "Fade in"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:22
msgid "Bounce in"
msgstr "Bounce in"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:23
msgid "Rotate in"
msgstr "Rotate in"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:24
msgid "Zoom in"
msgstr "Zoom in"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:25
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/setup.rst:67
msgid "…"
msgstr "…"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:27
msgid ""
"You can easily define an animation on a column in your custom theme. You "
"need to add two classes: `o_animate` and `o_anim_fade_in`. The second class "
"changes depending on the type of animation you want to use."
msgstr ""
"Можете лесно да зададете анимация на колона в персонализираната си тема. "
"Трябва да добавите два класа: `o_animate` и `o_anim_fade_in`. Вторият клас "
"се променя в зависимост от вида анимация, който искате да използвате."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:31
msgid ""
"Add the `o_animate_both_scroll` class to launch the animation every time the"
" column appears on the screen. The animation is only launched once by "
"default."
msgstr ""
"Добавете класа `o_animate_both_scroll`, за да стартирате анимацията всеки "
"път, когато колоната се появи на екрана. По подразбиране анимацията се "
"стартира само веднъж."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:34
msgid ""
"You should also define an `animation-duration` and an `animation-delay` "
"directly in the `style` attribute."
msgstr ""
"Трябва също да зададете `animation-duration` и `animation-delay` директно в "
"атрибута `style`."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:37
msgid ""
"Additionally, you can add an animation direction. For instance, to animate "
"the element from the bottom of the screen, add a `o_anim_from_bottom` class "
"and set a `--wanim-intensity` in the `style` attribute to control the "
"animation's direction intensity."
msgstr ""
"Освен това можете да добавите посока на анимацията. Например, за да "
"анимирате елемента от долната част на екрана, добавете клас "
"`o_anim_from_bottom` и задайте `--wanim-intensity` в атрибута `style`, за да"
" контролирате интензитета на посоката на анимацията."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:41
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:73
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:124
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/gradients.rst:18
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/shapes.rst:38
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:283
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:416
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:533
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:769
msgid "**Use**"
msgstr "**Използване**"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:None
msgid "Animation on appearance options"
msgstr "Опции за анимация при поява"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:56
msgid "On scroll"
msgstr "При скролиране"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:58
msgid ""
"In the same way as we have seen above, you can add animations on scroll to "
"column, text and image elements whenever the viewport scrolls through the "
