msgstr "Деактивира опцията за размер за всички дъщерни колони."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:173
msgid "Disable the size option for one specific column."
msgstr "Деактивира опцията за размер за една конкретна колона."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:182
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:333
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:366
msgid "Colors"
msgstr "Цветове"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:184
msgid ""
"Add a background based on the color palette for columns and `<section>`."
msgstr "Добавя фон, базиран на цветовата палитра, за колони и `<section>`."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:190
msgid "Disable the background color option for all columns."
msgstr "Деактивира опцията за цвят на фона за всички колони."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:196
msgid "Disable the background color option of one specific column."
msgstr "Деактивира опцията за цвят на фона на една конкретна колона."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:202
msgid "Add a black color filter with an opacity of 50%."
msgstr "Добавя черен цветен филтър с непрозрачност 50%."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:213
msgid "Add a white color filter with an opacity of 85%."
msgstr "Добавя бял цветен филтър с непрозрачност 85%."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:224
msgid "Add a custom color filter."
msgstr "Добавя персонализиран цветен филтър."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:235
