msgstr "Добавя персонализиран градиентен филтър."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:249
msgid "Features"
msgstr "Функции"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:254
