msgstr "Прави елемента нередактируем."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:262
msgid "Make an element not removable."
msgstr "Прави елемента неотстраним."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:271
msgid "Backgrounds"
msgstr "Фонове"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:273
msgid "Add a background image and have it centered."
msgstr "Добавя фоново изображение и го центрира."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:279
msgid "Add parallax effect."
msgstr "Добавя ефект на паралакс."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:290
msgid ""
"Update the ref below after the Media section has been created "
