#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:299
msgid "Text highlights"
msgstr "Текстови акценти (Text highlights)"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:301
msgid ""
"Text highlights are SVG files that can be incorporated onto specific words "
"or phrases to emphasize them. Text highlights offer customizable options for"
" colors and thickness."
msgstr ""
"Text highlights са SVG файлове, които могат да бъдат вградени върху "
"конкретни думи или фрази, за да ги подчертаят. Text highlights предлагат "
"персонализируеми опции за цветове и дебелина."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:None
msgid "Example of text highlight"
msgstr "Пример за text highlight"

