msgstr "`--text-highlight-width`"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:329
msgid "Thickness of the SVG borders"
msgstr "Дебелина на SVG рамките"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:330
msgid "`--text-highlight-color`"
msgstr "`--text-highlight-color`"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:331
msgid "Color of the SVG object"
msgstr "Цвят на SVG обекта"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:336
msgid "Grid layout"
msgstr "Grid оформление (Grid layout)"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:338
msgid ""
"Grid Layout is a powerful and flexible layout system in CSS that enables "
"users to design complex building block layouts with ease."
msgstr ""
"Grid Layout е мощна и гъвкава система за оформление в CSS, която позволява "
"на потребителите лесно да проектират сложни оформления на градивни елементи."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:344
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/media.rst:60
msgid "Use"
msgstr "Използване"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:346
msgid ""
"Enable the Grid Layout by adding the `o_grid_mode` CSS class on the `row`. "
"The number of rows in your grid is defined by the `data-row-count` "
"attribute. The grid always contains 12 columns. The grid gap, specified in "
"the `style` attribute, determines the gaps (or gutters) between rows and "
"columns."
msgstr ""
"Активирайте Grid Layout, като добавите CSS класа `o_grid_mode` към `row`. "
"Броят на редовете в решетката (grid) се определя от атрибута `data-row-"
"count`. Решетката винаги съдържа 12 колони. Разстоянието в решетката (grid "
"gap), зададено в атрибута `style`, определя разстоянията (gutters) между "
"редовете и колоните."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:360
msgid "Items in a grid"
msgstr "Елементи в решетка (grid)"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:362
msgid ""
"Add items in the grid with the `o_grid_item` class. If the grid item "
"contains an image, use the `o_grid_item_image` class."
msgstr ""
"Добавяйте елементи в решетката с класа `o_grid_item`. Ако елементът на "
"решетката съдържа изображение, използвайте класа `o_grid_item_image`."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:377
msgid ""
"The dimensions and position of a grid item are defined by the grid-area that"
" can be explicitly set in the `style` attribute along with the z-index."
msgstr ""
"Размерите и позицията на елемент от решетката се определят от grid-area, "
"който може да бъде зададен изрично в атрибута `style` заедно с z-index."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:380
msgid ""
"The `g-height-*` and `g-col-lg-*` classes are generated by the Website "
"Builder for editing purposes."
msgstr ""
"Класовете `g-height-*` и `g-col-lg-*` се генерират от Website Builder за "
"целите на редактирането."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:385
msgid "Grid item padding"
msgstr "Padding на елемент от решетката"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:403
msgid "`--grid-item-padding-y`"
msgstr "`--grid-item-padding-y`"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:404
msgid "Vertical paddings (Y axis)"
msgstr "Вертикални отстъпи (ос Y)"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:405
msgid "`--grid-item-padding-x`"
msgstr "`--grid-item-padding-x`"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:406
msgid "Horizontal paddings (X axis)"
msgstr "Хоризонтални отстъпи (ос X)"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:411
msgid "Compatibility system"
msgstr "Система за съвместимост"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:414
msgid ""
"When a snippet has a `data-vcss`, `data-vjs` and/or `data-vxml` attribute, "
"it means it is an updated"
msgstr ""
"Когато даден snippet има атрибут `data-vcss`, `data-vjs` и/или `data-vxml`, "
"това означава, че е обновена"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:414
msgid "version, not the original one."
msgstr "версия, а не оригиналната."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:422
msgid ""
"These data attributes indicate to the system which file version to load for "
"that snippet (e.g., :file:`001.js`, :file:`002.scss`)."
msgstr ""
"Тези data атрибути указват на системата коя версия на файла да зареди за "
"този snippet (напр. :file:`001.js`, :file:`002.scss`)."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:428
msgid "Custom snippet"
msgstr "Персонализиран snippet"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:430
msgid ""
"Some more specific needs will require the creation of custom snippets. Here "
"is how to create a custom snippet/"
msgstr ""
"Някои по-специфични нужди ще изискват създаването на персонализирани "
"snippets. Ето как да създадете персонализиран snippet/"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:436
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:582
#: ../../docs/content/developer/reference/frontend/assets.rst:42
msgid "Template"
msgstr "Шаблон"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:438
msgid ""
"Create first the snippet template. Then, add it to the list and make it "
"available via the Website Builder."
msgstr ""
"Първо създайте шаблона на snippet-а. След това го добавете в списъка и го "
"направете достъпен чрез Website Builder."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:442
msgid "1. Declaration"
msgstr "1. Деклариране"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:444
msgid "First, create the template of the custom snippet:"
msgstr "Първо създайте шаблона на персонализирания snippet:"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:446
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:587
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:598
msgid "``/website_airproof/views/snippets/s_airproof_snippet.xml``"
msgstr "``/website_airproof/views/snippets/s_airproof_snippet.xml``"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:461
msgid ""
"`data-name` and `data-snippet` attributes have to be specified when a "
"snippet is declared on a theme page. Otherwise, the snippet won't be "
"recognised by the Website Builder and issues might occur whenever a database"
" upgrade is done. Additionally, remember that the name attribute is shown as"
" the name of your custom snippet in the :guilabel:`Blocks` section of the "
"options panel."
msgstr ""
"Атрибутите `data-name` и `data-snippet` трябва да бъдат зададени, когато "
"даден snippet се декларира на страница на тема. В противен случай snippet-ът"
" няма да бъде разпознат от Website Builder и могат да възникнат проблеми при"
" надграждане на базата данни. Освен това не забравяйте, че атрибутът name се"
" показва като име на вашия персонализиран snippet в секцията "
":guilabel:`Blocks` на панела с опции."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:467
msgid "Use Bootstrap native classes as much as possible."
msgstr "Използвайте, доколкото е възможно, нативните класове на Bootstrap."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:468
msgid "Prefix all your custom classes."
msgstr ""
"Добавяйте представка (префикс) към всички ваши персонализирани класове."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:469
msgid ""
"Use underscore lowercase notation to name classes, e.g., `.x_nav`, "
"`.x_nav_item`."
msgstr ""
"Използвайте нотация с долни черти с малки букви за именуване на класовете, "
"напр. `.x_nav`, `.x_nav_item`."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:470
msgid ""
"Avoid using ID attribute within your `section` as several instances of a "
"snippet may appear throughout the page (An ID attribute has to be unique on "
"a page)."
msgstr ""
"Избягвайте използването на атрибут ID във вашия `section`, тъй като на "
"страницата може да се появят няколко екземпляра на един snippet (атрибутът "
"ID трябва да е уникален на страница)."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:473
msgid ""
"Add the custom snippet to the list of standard snippets, so the user can "
"drag and drop it on the page, directly from the edit panel."
msgstr ""
"Добавете персонализирания snippet към списъка със стандартни snippets, за да"
" може потребителят да го извлачи (drag and drop) на страницата директно от "
"панела за редактиране."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:477
msgid "2. Group creation"
msgstr "2. Създаване на група"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:479
msgid ""
"Add a group at the top of the list (feel free to put it where needed in this"
" list)."
msgstr ""
"Добавете група в началото на списъка (можете да я поставите и на друго място"
" в списъка, ако е необходимо)."

