msgid "t-thumbnail"
msgstr "t-thumbnail"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:505
msgid "The path to the thumbnail of the group"
msgstr "Пътят до миниатюрата (thumbnail) на групата"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:508
msgid "3. Snippet addition"
msgstr "3. Добавяне на сниппет"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:510
msgid ""
"Then add the custom snippet into the `<snippets id=\"snippet_structure\">` "
"which contains all existing ones on the same level. The Website Builder will"
" split them automatically into categories by reading the `group` attribute "
"on the `<t t-snippet=\"\">`"
msgstr ""
"След това добавете персонализирания snippet в `<snippets "
"id=\"snippet_structure\">`, който съдържа всички съществуващи такива на "
"същото ниво. Website Builder автоматично ще ги раздели на категории, като "
"прочете атрибута `group` на `<t t-snippet=\"\">`"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:540
msgid "The snippet template to use"
msgstr "Шаблонът на snippet-а, който да се използва"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:541
#: ../../docs/content/developer/tutorials/restrict_data_access.rst:156
msgid "group"
msgstr "group"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:542
msgid "The group in which the snippet is added."
msgstr "Групата, в която е добавен snippet-ът."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:543
msgid "<keywords>"
msgstr "<keywords>"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:544
msgid "Keywords entered by the user in the search field in the Snippets panel"
msgstr ""
"Ключови думи, въведени от потребителя в полето за търсене в панела Snippets"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:547
msgid "Inner content snippet"
msgstr "Snippet с вътрешно съдържание"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:549
msgid ""
"To make a custom snippet appearing in the :guilabel:`Inner content` list, "
"add it to the `snippet_content` instead:"
msgstr ""
"За да накарате даден потребителски сниппет да се появи в списъка "
":guilabel:`Inner content`, добавете го в `snippet_content` вместо това:"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:563
msgid ""
"Don't forget to add a `t-thumbnail` and remove the `group` attribute as this"
" kind of building blocks is directly available in the right options panel of"
" the Website Builder."
msgstr ""
"Не забравяйте да добавите `t-thumbnail` и да премахнете атрибута `group`, "
"тъй като този вид градивни блокове е директно достъпен в дясния панел с "
"опции на Website Builder."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:565
msgid ""
"Don't forget to :ref:`add the snippet to the list of all available \"Inner "
"content\" snippets "
"<website_themes/building_blocks/custom/options/inner_content>`."
msgstr ""
"Не забравяйте да :ref:`добавите сниппета към списъка с всички налични "
"сниппети „Inner content“ "
"<website_themes/building_blocks/custom/options/inner_content>`."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:571
#: ../../docs/content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:207
msgid "Options"
msgstr "Опции"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:573
msgid ""
"Options allow users to edit a snippet's appearance/behavior using the "
"Website Builder. You can create snippet options easily and automatically add"
" them to the Website Builder."
msgstr ""
"Опциите позволяват на потребителите да редактират външния вид/поведението на"
" сниппет чрез Website Builder. Можете лесно да създавате опции за сниппети и"
" автоматично да ги добавяте към Website Builder."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:577
msgid ""
"`Standard snippet options "
"<https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/247f28fdec788c7eb7c4288db29b931c73a23757/addons/website/views/snippets/snippets.xml>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Standard snippet options "
"<https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/247f28fdec788c7eb7c4288db29b931c73a23757/addons/website/views/snippets/snippets.xml>`_"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:584
msgid ""
"There are a bunch of commands to set the options of a custom snippet. These "
"options can be created into "
":file:`/website_airproof/views/snippets/s_airproof_snippet.xml`."
msgstr ""
"Съществуват редица команди за задаване на опциите на потребителски сниппет. "
"Тези опции могат да бъдат създадени във "
":file:`/website_airproof/views/snippets/s_airproof_snippet.xml`."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:596
msgid "Then insert the different available options:"
msgstr "След това вмъкнете различните налични опции:"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:623
msgid "**Inner content**"
msgstr "**Inner content**"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:625
msgid ""
"Make a custom snippet \"inner content\" (droppable in an other building "
"block) by extending the `so_content_addition_selector` variable which "
"contains all CSS selectors referring to the existing inner content building "
"blocks:"
msgstr ""
"Направете потребителски сниппет от тип „inner content“ (може да се пуска в "
"друг строителен блок), като разширите променливата "
"`so_content_addition_selector`, която съдържа всички CSS селектори, отнасящи"
" се до съществуващите строителни блокове от тип inner content:"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:629
msgid "`/website_airproof/views/snippets/options.xml`"
msgstr "`/website_airproof/views/snippets/options.xml`"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:641
msgid ""
"`Standard \"inner content\" snippets declaration on Odoo's GitHub repository"
" "
"<https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/cc05d9d50ac668eaa26363e1127f914897a4b125/addons/website/views/snippets/snippets.xml#L988>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Standard \"inner content\" snippets declaration on Odoo's GitHub repository"
" "
"<https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/cc05d9d50ac668eaa26363e1127f914897a4b125/addons/website/views/snippets/snippets.xml#L988>`_"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:646
msgid "Binding"
msgstr "Обвързване"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:648
msgid "These options use CSS selectors (class, XML tag, id, etc)."
msgstr "Тези опции използват CSS селектори (клас, XML таг, id и т.н.)."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:653
msgid "data-selector"
msgstr "data-selector"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:655
msgid ""
"Options are wrapped in groups. Groups can have properties that define how "
"the included options interact with the user interface."
msgstr ""
"Опциите са обвити в групи. Групите могат да имат свойства, които определят "
"как включените опции взаимодействат с потребителския интерфейс."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:658
msgid ""
"`data-selector` binds all the options included in the group to a particular "
"element matching the selector value (CSS class, ID, etc). The option will "
"appear when the matching selector is selected."
msgstr ""
"`data-selector` свързва всички опции, включени в групата, с конкретен "
"елемент, отговарящ на стойността на селектора (CSS клас, ID и т.н.). Опцията"
" ще се появи, когато съответният селектор е избран."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:665
msgid ""
"It can be used in combination with other attributes like `data-target`, "
"`data-exclude` or `data-apply-to`."
msgstr ""
"Може да се използва в комбинация с други атрибути като `data-target`, `data-"
"exclude` или `data-apply-to`."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:671
msgid "data-target"
msgstr "data-target"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:673
msgid ""
"`data-target=\"\"` allows to apply the option to a child element of the "
"`data-selector=\"\"`."
msgstr ""
"`data-target=\"\"` позволява прилагането на опцията към дъщерен елемент на "
"`data-selector=\"\"`."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:684
msgid "data-exclude"
msgstr "data-exclude"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:686
msgid ""
"`data-exclude=\"\"` allows to exclude some particular selectors from the "
"rule."
msgstr ""
"`data-exclude=\"\"` позволява изключването на определени селектори от "
"правилото."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:688
msgid ""
"The option appears if an `<ul>` tag (without `.navbar-nav` class) is "
"selected"
msgstr "Опцията се появява, ако е избран таг `<ul>` (без клас `.navbar-nav`)"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:698
msgid "data-drop-in"
msgstr "data-drop-in"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:700
msgid ""
"`data-drop-in` defines the list of elements where the snippet can be dropped"
" into."
msgstr ""
"`data-drop-in` определя списъка с елементи, в които сниппетът може да бъде "
"пуснат."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:709
msgid "data-drop-near"
msgstr "data-drop-near"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:711
msgid ""
"`data-drop-near` defines the list of elements where the snippet can be "
"dropped beside."
msgstr ""
"`data-drop-near` определя списъка с елементи, до които сниппетът може да "
"бъде пуснат."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:720
msgid "data-js"
msgstr "data-js"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:722
msgid "`data-js` binds a custom JavaScript methods."
msgstr "`data-js` свързва потребителски JavaScript методи."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:731
msgid "Layout & fields"
msgstr "Оформление и полета"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:736
msgid "`<we-title>`"
msgstr "`<we-title>`"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:738
msgid "Add titles between options to categorize them."
msgstr "Добавете заглавия между опциите, за да ги категоризирате."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:None
msgid "Add a subtitle between custom options"
msgstr "Добавяне на подзаглавие между потребителски опции"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:751
msgid "`<we-row>`"
msgstr "`<we-row>`"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:753
msgid "Create a row in which elements is displayed next to each other."
msgstr "Създава ред, в който елементите се показват един до друг."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:762
msgid "The perfect example for this case is the :guilabel:`Animation` row:"
msgstr "Идеалният пример за този случай е редът :guilabel:`Animation`:"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:None
msgid "Group different option fields into the same row."
msgstr "Групирайте различни полета на опции в един и същ ред."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:770
msgid "`<we-button>`"
msgstr "`<we-button>`"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:772
msgid "This tag is used inside `<we-select>` and `<we-button-group>`."
msgstr "Този таг се използва вътре в `<we-select>` и `<we-button-group>`."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:783
msgid ""
"Add `data-select-class=\"\"` to indicate which class is added to the "
"targeted element when this choice is selected. Like any XML node, add other "
"attributes allows to improve the style and/or the user experience."
msgstr ""
"Добавете `data-select-class=\"\"`, за да укажете кой клас се добавя към "
"целевия елемент, когато този избор бъде избран. Както при всеки XML възел, "
"добавянето на други атрибути позволява подобряване на стила и/или "
"потребителското изживяване."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:None
msgid "Add option choices and style them with some icons"
msgstr "Добавете опции за избор и ги стилизирайте с икони"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:801
msgid "`<we-select>`"
msgstr "`<we-select>`"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:803
msgid ""
"Formats the option as a dropdown list. Add `string=\"\"` to indicate the "
"field name."
msgstr ""
"Форматира опцията като падащ списък. Добавете `string=\"\"`, за да укажете "
"името на полето."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:None
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:None
msgid "Add a dropddown list field"
msgstr "Добавяне на поле с падащ списък"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:816
msgid "`<we-button-group>`"
msgstr "`<we-button-group>`"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:818
msgid "Formats the option as buttons next to each other."
msgstr "Форматира опцията като бутони един до друг."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:831
msgid "`<we-checkbox>`"
msgstr "`<we-checkbox>`"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:833
msgid "Formats the option as a toggle switch."
msgstr "Форматира опцията като превключвател."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:None
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:None
msgid "Add a toggle switch."
msgstr "Добавете превключвател."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:848
msgid "`<we-range>`"
msgstr "`<we-range>`"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:850
msgid "Formats the option as a slider."
msgstr "Форматира опцията като плъзгач."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:858
msgid ""
"Each step of the range is separated by a `|`. Here, each class name "
"corresponds to a step."
msgstr ""
"Всяка стъпка на диапазона е разделена с `|`. Тук всяко име на клас "
"съответства на стъпка."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:867
msgid "`<we-input>`"
msgstr "`<we-input>`"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:869
msgid "Formats the option as a text field."
msgstr "Форматира опцията като текстово поле."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:871
msgid "`data-unit`, `data-save-unit` and `data-step` are optional"
msgstr "`data-unit`, `data-save-unit` и `data-step` са незадължителни"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:None
msgid "Add a text field."
msgstr "Добавяне на текстово поле."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:885
msgid ""
"`<we-input>` comes with optional attributes particularly useful in specific "
"case:"
msgstr ""
"`<we-input>` идва с незадължителни атрибути, особено полезни в конкретни "
"случаи:"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:894
msgid "`data-unit`"
msgstr "`data-unit`"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:895
msgid "Shows the expected unit of measure."
msgstr "Показва очакваната мерна единица."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:896
msgid "`data-save-unit`"
msgstr "`data-save-unit`"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:897
msgid ""
"Set the unit of measure to which the value entered by the user is converted "
"and saved."
msgstr ""
"Задава мерната единица, към която се преобразува и запазва въведената от "
"потребителя стойност."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:898
msgid "`data-step`"
msgstr "`data-step`"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:899
msgid "Set the numerical value by which the field can be incremented."
msgstr ""
"Задава числовата стойност, с която полето може да бъде "
"увеличавано/намалявано."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:904
msgid "`<we-colorpicker>`"
msgstr "`<we-colorpicker>`"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:906
msgid "Formats the option as a color/gradient to choose from."
msgstr "Форматира опцията като цвят/градиент за избор."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:None
msgid "Add a colorpicker."
msgstr "Добавя цветоизбирач."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:928
msgid "`data-select-style`"
msgstr "`data-select-style`"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:929
msgid ""
"Refers to `selectStyle` JavaScript method. Matchs the value of the "
"`style=\"\"` attribute applied on the target to thick the right option "
"choice."
msgstr ""
"Отнася се до JavaScript метода `selectStyle`. Съпоставя стойността на "
"атрибута `style=\"\"`, приложен върху целта, за да отбележи правилния избор "
"на опция."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:931
msgid "`data-css-property`"
msgstr "`data-css-property`"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:932
msgid "Define the CSS property targeted by the colorpicker."
msgstr "Определя CSS свойството, към което е насочен избирачът на цвят."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:933
msgid "`data-color-prefix`"
msgstr "`data-color-prefix`"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:934
msgid "Define the prefix applied to the CSS class returned."
msgstr "Определя префикса, приложен към върнатия CSS клас."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:935
msgid "`data-apply-to`"
msgstr "`data-apply-to`"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:936
msgid "Set the element on which the color is applied."
msgstr "Задава елемента, върху който се прилага цветът."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:941
#: ../../docs/content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:61
msgid "Methods"
msgstr "Методи"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:943
msgid ""
"Beside *binding options* allowing to select, target or exclude an element. "
"Option fields have several useful data attributes refering to standard "
"JavaScript methods."
msgstr ""
"Освен *свързващи опции*, позволяващи избиране, насочване или изключване на "
"елемент, полетата за опции имат няколко полезни атрибута за данни, отнасящи "
"се до стандартни JavaScript методи."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:946
msgid ""
"For example, `data-select-class` refers to the JavaScript method named "
"`selectClass`."
msgstr ""
"Например `data-select-class` се отнася до JavaScript метода, наречен "
"`selectClass`."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:951
msgid "Built-in methods"
msgstr "Вградени методи"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:956
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/setup.rst:66
#: ../../docs/content/developer/tutorials/importable_modules.rst:238
#: ../../docs/content/developer/tutorials/importable_modules.rst:449
#: ../../docs/content/developer/tutorials/server_framework_101/03_basicmodel.rst:199
#: ../../docs/content/developer/tutorials/server_framework_101/07_relations.rst:242
msgid "Selection"
msgstr "Selection"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:958
msgid ""
"There are several built-in methods available. They are callable by using the"
" related data attribute directly into the XML template."
msgstr ""
"Съществуват няколко налични вградени метода. Те могат да бъдат извиквани "
"чрез използване на съответния атрибут за данни директно в XML шаблона."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:966
msgid "Data attributes"
msgstr "Атрибути за данни"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:968
msgid "`data-select-class`"
msgstr "`data-select-class`"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:969
msgid ""
"Allows to select one and only one class in the option classes set and set it"
" on the associated snippet."
msgstr ""
"Позволява да се избере един и само един клас от набора класове на опцията и "
"да се зададе на асоциирания сниппет."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:971
msgid "`data-select-data-attribute` + `data-attribute-name`"
msgstr "`data-select-data-attribute` + `data-attribute-name`"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:972
msgid ""
"Allows to select a value and set it on the associated snippet as an "
"attribute. The attribute name is given by the `data-attribute-name` "
"attribute."
msgstr ""
"Позволява да се избере стойност и да се зададе на асоциирания сниппет като "
"атрибут. Името на атрибута се дава от атрибута `data-attribute-name`."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:974
msgid "`data-select-property` + `data-property-name`"
msgstr "`data-select-property` + `data-property-name`"

