#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/gradients.rst:3
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:488
msgid "Gradients"
msgstr "Градиенти"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/gradients.rst:7
msgid "Add a gradient to a section or a title."
msgstr "Добавяне на градиент към секция или заглавие."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/gradients.rst:8
msgid "Add a custom gradient to the Website Builder palette."
msgstr "Добавяне на персонализиран градиент към палитрата на Website Builder."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/gradients.rst:13
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:375
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:617
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/shapes.rst:34
msgid "Standard"
msgstr "Стандартно"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/gradients.rst:15
msgid ""
"In standard, several gradients can be selected directly from the Website "
"Builder. However, for custom themes, gradients have to be added directly in "
"the `section` tag with a `style` attribute."
msgstr ""
"В стандартния случай няколко градиента могат да бъдат избрани директно от "
"Website Builder. Въпреки това, за персонализирани теми градиентите трябва да"
" бъдат добавени директно в тага `section` чрез атрибут `style`."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/gradients.rst:26
msgid ""
"To apply a gradient to text, use a `font` tag with the `text-gradient` "
"class."
msgstr ""
"За да приложите градиент върху текст, използвайте таг `font` с класа `text-"
"gradient`."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/gradients.rst:37
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:432
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:653
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/shapes.rst:166
msgid "Custom"
msgstr "Персонализирано"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/gradients.rst:39
msgid ""
"Add a custom gradient to the Website Builder. This way, the user can easily "
"use them without manually recreating them."
msgstr ""
"Добавяне на персонализиран градиент към Website Builder. По този начин "
"потребителят може лесно да ги използва, без да се налага ръчно да ги "
"пресъздава."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/gradients.rst:42
#: ../../docs/content/developer/tutorials/website_theme/04_customisation_part2.rst:103
msgid "``/website_airproof/data/gradients.xml``"
msgstr "``/website_airproof/data/gradients.xml``"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:5
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/navigation.rst:7
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/translations.rst:7
msgid "In this chapter, you will learn how to:"
msgstr "В тази глава ще научите как да:"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:7
msgid "Create a custom header."
msgstr "Създадете персонализиран хедър."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:8
msgid "Create a custom footer."
msgstr "Създадете персонализиран футър."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:9
msgid "Modify a standard template."
msgstr "Модифицирате стандартен шаблон."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:10
msgid "Add a copyright section."
msgstr "Добавите секция с авторски права."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:11
msgid "Improve your website's responsiveness."
msgstr "Подобрите отзивчивостта на вашия уебсайт."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:16
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/navigation.rst:16
#: ../../docs/content/developer/tutorials/server_framework_101/08_compute_onchange.rst:171
msgid "Default"
msgstr "По подразбиране"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:18
msgid ""
"An Odoo page combines cross-page and unique elements. Cross-page elements "
"are the same on every page, while unique elements are only related to a "
"specific page. By default, a page has two cross-page elements, the header "
"and the footer, and a unique main element that contains the specific content"
" of that page."
msgstr ""
"Дадена страница в Odoo съчетава елементи, общи за всички страници, и "
"уникални елементи. Общите елементи са едни и същи на всяка страница, докато "
"уникалните елементи са свързани само с конкретна страница. По подразбиране "
"страницата има два общи елемента — хедър и футър, и уникален главен елемент,"
" който съдържа специфичното съдържание на тази страница."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:35
msgid ""
"Any Odoo XML file starts with encoding specifications. After that, you must "
"write your code inside an `<odoo>` tag."
msgstr ""
"Всеки XML файл в Odoo започва със спецификации за кодировка. След това "
"трябва да напишете кода си вътре в таг `<odoo>`."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:46
msgid ""
"Using precise template names is important to find information through all "
"modules quickly. Template names should only contain lowercase alphanumerics "
"and underscores."
msgstr ""
"Използването на точни имена на шаблони е важно, за да можете бързо да "
"намирате информация във всички модули. Имената на шаблоните трябва да "
"съдържат само малки буквено-цифрови символи и долни черти."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:49
msgid ""
"Always add an empty line at the end of your file. This can be done "
"automatically by configuring your IDE."
msgstr ""
"Винаги добавяйте празен ред в края на файла си. Това може да се направи "
"автоматично чрез конфигуриране на вашата IDE среда."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:55
msgid "XPath"
msgstr "XPath"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:57
msgid ""
"XPath (XML Path Language) is an expression language that enables you to "
"navigate through elements and attributes in an XML document easily. XPath is"
" used to extend standard Odoo templates."
msgstr ""
"XPath (XML Path Language) е език за изрази, който ви позволява лесно да "
"навигирате през елементи и атрибути в XML документ. XPath се използва за "
"разширяване на стандартните шаблони на Odoo."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:60
msgid "A view is coded the following way."
msgstr "Даден изглед се кодира по следния начин."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:76
msgid "ID of the modified view"
msgstr "ID на модифицирания изглед"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:77
msgid "inherited_id"
msgstr "inherited_id"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:78
msgid ""
"ID of the standard view (using the following pattern: `module.template`)"
msgstr "ID на стандартния изглед (по следния модел: `module.template`)"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:80
msgid "Human-readable name of the modified view"
msgstr "Четимо за човек име на модифицирания изглед"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:82
msgid ""
"For each XPath, you modify two attributes: **expression** and **position**."
msgstr ""
"За всеки XPath модифицирате два атрибута: **expression** и **position**."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:85
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:444
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:483
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:660
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:685
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:705
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/navigation.rst:247
msgid "``/website_airproof/views/website_templates.xml``"
msgstr "``/website_airproof/views/website_templates.xml``"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:94
msgid "This XPath adds a welcome message right before the page content."
msgstr ""
"Този XPath добавя приветствено съобщение непосредствено преди съдържанието "
"на страницата."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:97
msgid ""
"Be careful when replacing default elements' attributes. As your theme "
"extends the default one, your changes will take priority over any future "
"Odoo update."
msgstr ""
"Бъдете внимателни, когато заменяте атрибутите на елементите по подразбиране."
" Тъй като вашата тема разширява темата по подразбиране, вашите промени ще "
"имат приоритет пред всяка бъдеща актуализация на Odoo."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:101
msgid ""
"You should update your module every time you create a new template or "
"record."
msgstr ""
"Трябва да обновявате модула си всеки път, когато създадете нов шаблон или "
"запис."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:102
msgid ""
"*XML IDs* of inheriting views should use the same *ID* as the original "
"record. It helps to find all inheritance at a glance. As final *XML IDs* are"
" prefixed by the module that creates them, there is no overlap."
msgstr ""
"*XML ID* на наследяващите изгледи трябва да използва същото *ID* като "
"оригиналния запис. Това помага да се откриват всички наследявания на пръв "
"поглед. Тъй като крайните *XML ID* се предхождат от модула, който ги "
"създава, няма застъпване."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:109
msgid "Expressions"
msgstr "Изрази"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:111
msgid ""
"XPath uses path expressions to select nodes in an XML document. Selectors "
"are used inside the expression to target the right element. The most useful "
"ones are listed below."
msgstr ""
"XPath използва изрази за пътища, за да избира възли в XML документ. "
"Селектори се използват вътре в израза, за да се насочат към правилния "
"елемент. Най-полезните от тях са изброени по-долу."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:119
msgid "Descendent selectors"
msgstr "Селектори за наследници"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:121
msgid "/"
msgstr "/"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:122
msgid "Selects from the root node."
msgstr "Избира от кореновия възел."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:123
msgid "//"
msgstr "//"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:124
msgid ""
"Selects nodes in the document from the current node that matches the "
"selection no matter where they are."
msgstr ""
"Избира възли в документа от текущия възел, които отговарят на селекцията, "
"независимо къде се намират."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:132
msgid "Attribute selectors"
msgstr "Селектори по атрибут"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:134
msgid "\\*"
msgstr "\\*"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:135
msgid ""
"Selects any XML tag. `*` can be replaced by a specific tag if the selection "
"needs to be more precise."
msgstr ""
"Избира произволен XML таг. `*` може да бъде заменен с конкретен таг, ако "
"селекцията трябва да бъде по-прецизна."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:137
msgid "\\*[@id=\"id\"]"
msgstr "\\*[@id=\"id\"]"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:138
msgid "Selects a specific ID."
msgstr "Избира конкретно ID."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:139
msgid "\\*[hasclass(\"class\")]"
msgstr "\\*[hasclass(\"class\")]"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:140
msgid "Selects a specific class."
msgstr "Избира конкретен клас."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:141
msgid "\\*[@name=\"name\"]"
msgstr "\\*[@name=\"name\"]"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:142
msgid "Selects a tag with a specific name."
msgstr "Избира таг с конкретно име."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:143
msgid "\\*[@t-call=\"t-call\"]"
msgstr "\\*[@t-call=\"t-call\"]"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:144
msgid "Selects a specific t-call."
msgstr "Избира конкретен t-call."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:149
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:159
msgid "Position"
msgstr "Position"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:151
msgid ""
"The position defines where the code is placed inside the template. The "
"possible values are listed below:"
msgstr ""
"Атрибутът position определя къде се поставя кодът вътре в шаблона. "
"Възможните стойности са изброени по-долу:"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:161
msgid "replace"
msgstr "replace"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:162
msgid "Replaces the targeted node with the XPath content."
msgstr "Заменя целевия възел със съдържанието на XPath."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:163
msgid "inside"
msgstr "inside"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:164
msgid "Adds the XPath content inside the targeted node."
msgstr "Добавя съдържанието на XPath вътре в целевия възел."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:165
msgid "before"
msgstr "before"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:166
msgid "Adds the XPath content before the targeted node."
msgstr "Добавя съдържанието на XPath преди целевия възел."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:167
msgid "after"
msgstr "after"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:168
msgid "Adds the XPath content after the targeted node."
msgstr "Добавя съдържанието на XPath след целевия възел."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:169
#: ../../docs/content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:196
msgid "attributes"
msgstr "attributes"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:170
msgid "Adds the XPath content inside an attribute."
msgstr "Добавя съдържанието на XPath вътре в атрибут."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:173
msgid "This XPath removes the first element with a `.breadcrumb` class."
msgstr "Този XPath премахва първия елемент с клас `.breadcrumb`."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:179
msgid ""
"This XPath adds an extra `<li>` element after the last child of the `<ul>` "
"element."
msgstr ""
"Този XPath добавя допълнителен елемент `<li>` след последното дете на "
"елемента `<ul>`."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:187
msgid ""
"This XPath adds a `<div>` before the `<nav>` that is a direct child of the "
"`<header>`."
msgstr ""
"Този XPath добавя `<div>` преди `<nav>`, който е директно дете на "
"`<header>`."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:195
msgid ""
