#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/media.rst:105
msgid ""
"To make sure that your images don't slow down your web page and don't weigh "
"too much, try to respect these few points:"
msgstr ""
"За да сте сигурни, че изображенията ви не забавят уеб страницата и не тежат "
