#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/navigation.rst:158
msgid ""
"A mega menu is a dropdown menu with additional possibilities and not just a "
"list of links. In a mega menu, you can use any kind of content (text, "
"images, icons, ...)."
