#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:None
#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:None
msgid "Theme colors"
msgstr "Цветове на темата"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:410
msgid ""
"Add the created palette to the list of palettes offered by the Website "
"Builder."
msgstr ""
"Добавете създадената палитра към списъка с палитри, предлагани от Website "
"Builder."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:None
msgid "Theme colors Airproof"
msgstr "Цветове на темата Airproof"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:431
msgid "**Color combinations**"
msgstr "**Комбинации от цветове**"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:433
msgid ""
"Based on the previously defined five color palettes, the Website Builder "
"automatically generates five color combinations, each defining a color for "
"the background, text, headings, links, primary buttons, and secondary "
"buttons. These colors can be customized later by the user."
msgstr ""
"Въз основа на предварително дефинираните пет цветови палитри, Website "
"Builder автоматично генерира пет комбинации от цветове, всяка от които "
"дефинира цвят за фона, текста, заглавията, линковете, основните бутони и "
"вторичните бутони. Тези цветове могат да бъдат персонализирани по-късно от "
"потребителя."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:441
msgid ""
"The colors used in a color combination are accessible and can be overridden "
"through `$o-color-palettes` using a specific prefix (`o-cc` for `color "
"combination`)."
msgstr ""
"Цветовете, използвани в дадена комбинация от цветове, са достъпни и могат да"
" бъдат заменени чрез `$o-color-palettes`, използвайки специфичен префикс "
"(`o-cc` за `color combination`)."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:470
msgid ""
"For each `o-cc*`, replace the `*` with the digit (1 - 5) corresponding to "
"the desired color combination."
msgstr ""
"За всеки `o-cc*` заменете `*` с цифрата (1 - 5), съответстваща на желаната "
"комбинация от цветове."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:473
msgid ""
"The default text color is `o-color-5`. If the background is too dark, it "
"will automatically change to the `o-color-4` color."
msgstr ""
"Цветът на текста по подразбиране е `o-color-5`. Ако фонът е твърде тъмен, "
"той автоматично ще се промени на цвят `o-color-4`."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:477
msgid ""
"`Color combinations SCSS "
"<https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/c272c49657e8b7865bb93e5f1dcc183cc7d44f17/addons/web_editor/static/src/scss/web_editor.common.scss#L16>`_"
msgstr ""
"`SCSS с цветови комбинации "
"<https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/c272c49657e8b7865bb93e5f1dcc183cc7d44f17/addons/web_editor/static/src/scss/web_editor.common.scss#L16>`_"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:482
msgid ""
"The Website Builder automatically generates a page to view the color "
"combinations of the theme color palette: "
"http://localhost:8069/website/demo/color-combinations"
msgstr ""
"Website Builder автоматично генерира страница за преглед на комбинациите от "
"цветове на цветовата палитра на темата: "
"http://localhost:8069/website/demo/color-combinations"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:490
msgid ""
"You can also define gradients for the menu, header, footer and copyright "
"bar, directly in your `primary_variables.scss` file."
msgstr ""
"Можете също да дефинирате градиенти за менюто, хедъра, футъра и лентата с "
"авторски права директно във файла `primary_variables.scss`."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:510
msgid "Bootstrap variables"
msgstr "Bootstrap променливи"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:512
msgid ""
"Odoo includes Bootstrap by default. You can use all variables and mixins of "
"the framework."
msgstr ""
"Odoo включва Bootstrap по подразбиране. Можете да използвате всички "
"променливи и миксини на framework-а."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:514
msgid ""
"If Odoo does not provide the variable you are looking for, there could be a "
"Bootstrap variable that allows it. Indeed all Odoo layouts respect Bootstrap"
" structures and use Bootstrap components or their extensions. If you "
"customize a Bootstrap variable, you add a generic style for the whole user "
"website."
msgstr ""
"Ако Odoo не предоставя променливата, която търсите, може да съществува "
"Bootstrap променлива, която го позволява. Всъщност всички оформления на Odoo"
" спазват Bootstrap структурите и използват Bootstrap компоненти или техни "
"разширения. Ако персонализирате Bootstrap променлива, добавяте общ стил за "
"целия уебсайт на потребителя."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:519
msgid ""
"Use a dedicated file added to the :file:`_assets_frontend_helpers` bundle to"
" override Bootstrap values and *not* the :file:`primary_variables.scss` "
"file."
msgstr ""
"Използвайте специален файл, добавен в пакета "
":file:`_assets_frontend_helpers`, за да замените Bootstrap стойностите, а "
"*не* файла :file:`primary_variables.scss`."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:535
msgid "``/website_airproof/static/src/scss/bootstrap_overridden.scss``"
msgstr "``/website_airproof/static/src/scss/bootstrap_overridden.scss``"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:554
msgid ""
"Don't override Bootstrap variables that depend on Odoo variables. Otherwise,"
" you might break the possibility for the user to customize them using the "
"Website Builder."
msgstr ""
"Не заменяйте Bootstrap променливи, които зависят от променливи на Odoo. В "
"противен случай може да нарушите възможността на потребителя да ги "
"персонализира чрез Website Builder."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:557
msgid ""
"When an option is defined by a variable in `primary_variables.scss` and by a"
" Boostrap variable, you should always go for an override through the primary"
" variables. Do it via `bootstrap_overridden.scss` only if nothing exists in "
"the primary variables."
msgstr ""
"Когато дадена опция е дефинирана както от променлива в "
"`primary_variables.scss`, така и от Bootstrap променлива, винаги трябва да "
"предпочитате override чрез основните променливи. Правете го чрез "
"`bootstrap_overridden.scss` само ако нищо не съществува в основните "
"променливи."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:562
msgid ""
"`Bootstrap overridden SCSS "
"<https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/18.0/addons/web/static/lib/bootstrap/scss/_variables.scss>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Заменени SCSS променливи на Bootstrap "
"<https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/18.0/addons/web/static/lib/bootstrap/scss/_variables.scss>`_"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:567
