#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:735
msgid ""
"For some options, in addition to the Website Builder variable, you also have"
" to activate a specific view."
msgstr ""
"За някои опции, освен променливата на Website Builder, трябва да активирате "
"и конкретен изглед."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:738
msgid ""
"By reading the source code, templates related to options are easily found."
msgstr ""
"Чрез четене на изходния код, шаблоните, свързани с опциите, се намират "
"лесно."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:755
msgid ""
"In such cases, the ``<template id=\"...\">`` syntax should be preferred over"
" the ``<record id=\"...\" model=\"ir.ui.view\">`` syntax when defining the "
"record in XML."
msgstr ""
"В такива случаи, синтаксисът ``<template id=\"...\">`` трябва да се "
"предпочита пред синтаксиса ``<record id=\"...\" model=\"ir.ui.view\">`` при "
"дефиниране на записа в XML."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:759
msgid ""
"See :ref:`reference/data/template`, especially about the ``active`` value."
msgstr ""
"Вижте :ref:`reference/data/template`, особено относно стойността ``active``."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:764
msgid "Presets"
msgstr "Предварителни настройки"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:766
