#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:811
#: ../../docs/content/developer/reference/frontend/assets.rst:6
msgid "Assets"
msgstr "Assets"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:813
msgid ""
"For this part, we will refer to the `assets_frontend` bundle located in the "
"web module. This bundle specifies the list of assets loaded by the Website "
"Builder, and the goal is to add your SCSS and JS files to the bundle."
msgstr ""
"За тази част ще се позовем на пакета `assets_frontend`, разположен в модула "
"web. Този пакет определя списъка с активи, зареждани от Website Builder, а "
"целта е да добавите вашите SCSS и JS файлове към пакета."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:817
msgid ""
"This is a non-exhaustive list of the frequently used bundles for a website:"
msgstr "Това е неизчерпателен списък с често използваните пакети за уебсайт:"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:824
msgid "Bundle"
msgstr "Пакет"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:826
msgid "web._assets_primary_variables"
msgstr "web._assets_primary_variables"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:827
msgid ""
"Defines the primary SCSS variables (colors, fonts, spacing, etc) used as the"
" main theming layer across all bundles. Mainly used for the "
":file:`primary_variables.scss` file."
msgstr ""
"Дефинира основните SCSS променливи (цветове, шрифтове, разстояния и др.), "
"използвани като основен слой за тематизиране във всички пакети. Основно се "
"използва за файла :file:`primary_variables.scss`."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:829
msgid "web._assets_secondary_variables"
msgstr "web._assets_secondary_variables"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:830
msgid ""
"Defines secondary SCSS variables that depend on and extend the primary "
"variables. Mainly used for the :file:`secondary_variables.scss` file."
msgstr ""
"Дефинира вторични SCSS променливи, които зависят от основните променливи и "
"ги разширяват. Основно се използва за файла "
":file:`secondary_variables.scss`."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:832
msgid "web._assets_frontend_helpers"
msgstr "web._assets_frontend_helpers"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:833
msgid ""
"Provides frontend-specific Bootstrap overrides to be included before any "
"frontend SCSS compilation. Mainly used for the "
":file:`bootstrap_overridden.scss` file."
msgstr ""
"Осигурява специфични за frontend Bootstrap override-и, които трябва да бъдат"
" включени преди всяко компилиране на frontend SCSS. Основно се използва за "
"файла :file:`bootstrap_overridden.scss`."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:835
msgid "web.assets_frontend"
msgstr "web.assets_frontend"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:836
msgid ""
"Provides the base assets required to render and interact with Odoo's "
"frontend. You can add all your custom SCSS, JS or client-side QWeb "
"templates."
msgstr ""
"Осигурява базовите активи, необходими за визуализация и взаимодействие с "
"frontend частта на Odoo. Можете да добавяте всички ваши персонализирани "
"SCSS, JS или клиентски QWeb шаблони."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:838
msgid "website.assets_wysiwyg"
msgstr "website.assets_wysiwyg"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:839
msgid ""
"Provides the assets loaded into the web editor context, including edit-mode "
"styles, custom method for a custom building block, etc)."
msgstr ""
"Осигурява активите, зареждани в контекста на уеб редактора, включително "
"стиловете за режим на редактиране, персонализиран метод за персонализиран "
"градивен блок и т.н.)."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:841
msgid "web._assets_bootstrap"
msgstr "web._assets_bootstrap"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:842
msgid ""
"If you need to extend Boostrap through the Bootstrap Utilities API, for "
"example"
msgstr ""
"Ако трябва да разширите Bootstrap чрез Bootstrap Utilities API, например"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:847
msgid "Styles"
msgstr "Стилове"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:849
msgid ""
"The Website Builder together with Bootstrap are great for defining the basic"
" styles of your website. But to design something unique, you should go a "
"step further. For this, you can easily add any SCSS file to your theme."
msgstr ""
"Website Builder заедно с Bootstrap са чудесни за дефиниране на основните "
"стилове на вашия уебсайт. Но за да проектирате нещо уникално, трябва да "
"направите крачка напред. За тази цел можете лесно да добавите произволен "
"SCSS файл към темата си."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:864
msgid ""
"Feel free to reuse the variables from your Bootstrap file and the ones used "
"by Odoo in your :file:`theme.scss` file."
msgstr ""
"Не се колебайте да преизползвате променливите от вашия Bootstrap файл, както"
" и тези, използвани от Odoo, във вашия файл :file:`theme.scss`."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:868
msgid "``/website_airproof/static/src/scss/theme.scss``"
msgstr "``/website_airproof/static/src/scss/theme.scss``"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:880
msgid "Interactivity"
msgstr "Интерактивност"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:882
msgid "Odoo supports three different kinds of JavaScript files:"
msgstr "Odoo поддържа три различни вида JavaScript файлове:"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:884
msgid ""
":ref:`plain JavaScript files <frontend/modules/plain_js>` (no module "
"system),"
msgstr ""
":ref:`обикновени JavaScript файлове <frontend/modules/plain_js>` (без "
"система за модули),"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:885
msgid ":ref:`native JavaScript module <frontend/modules/native_js>`, and"
msgstr ":ref:`нативен JavaScript модул <frontend/modules/native_js>`, и"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:886
msgid ""
":ref:`Odoo modules <frontend/modules/odoo_module>` (using a custom module "
"system)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Odoo модули <frontend/modules/odoo_module>` (използващи "
"персонализирана система за модули)."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:888
msgid ""
"Most new Odoo JavaScript codes should use the native JavaScript module "
"system. It's simpler and brings the benefit of a better developer experience"
" with better integration with the IDE."
msgstr ""
"Повечето нови JavaScript кодове на Odoo трябва да използват нативната "
"система за JavaScript модули. Тя е по-проста и носи предимството на по-добро"
" изживяване за разработчика с по-добра интеграция с IDE."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:903
msgid ""
"If you want to include files from an external library, you can add them to "
"the :file:`/lib` folder of your module."
msgstr ""
"Ако искате да включите файлове от външна библиотека, можете да ги добавите в"
" папката :file:`/lib` на вашия модул."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:907
msgid "Use a linter (JSHint, ...)."
msgstr "Използвайте linter (JSHint, ...)."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:908
msgid "Always add minified JavaScript libraries."
msgstr "Винаги добавяйте минифицирани JavaScript библиотеки."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:909
msgid ""
"Add `'use strict';` at the top of every old-style module (this is automatic "
"for new-style modules)."
msgstr ""
"Добавете `'use strict';` в началото на всеки модул от стар стил (при "
"модулите от нов стил това е автоматично)."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:911
msgid "Use `js_` prefixed CSS classes on elements you target with JavaScript."
msgstr ""
"Използвайте CSS класове с представка `js_` за елементите, които таргетирате "
"с JavaScript."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:912
msgid ""
"Variables and functions should be *camelCased* (`myVariable`) instead of "
"*snake_cased* (`my_variable`)."
msgstr ""
"Променливите и функциите трябва да бъдат в *camelCase* (`myVariable`), а не "
"в *snake_case* (`my_variable`)."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:914
msgid ""
"Do not name a variable `event`; use `ev` instead. This is to avoid bugs on "
"non-Chrome browsers, as Chrome is magically assigning a global `event` "
"variable (so if you use the `event` variable without declaring it, it will "
"work fine on Chrome but crash on every other browser)."
msgstr ""
"Не наименувайте променлива `event`; вместо това използвайте `ev`. Това е за "
"да избегнете бъгове в браузъри, различни от Chrome, тъй като Chrome по "
"магически начин присвоява глобална променлива `event` (така че ако "
"използвате променливата `event` без да я декларирате, тя ще работи нормално "
"в Chrome, но ще се срине във всеки друг браузър)."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:918
msgid "Use strict comparisons (`===` instead of `==`)."
msgstr "Използвайте строги сравнения (`===` вместо `==`)."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:919
msgid ""
"Use double quotes for all textual strings (such as `\"Hello\"`) and single "
"quotes for all other strings, such as a CSS selector `.x_nav_item`."
msgstr ""
"Използвайте двойни кавички за всички текстови низове (като `\"Hello\"`) и "
"единични кавички за всички останали низове, като CSS селектор `.x_nav_item`."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:921
msgid ""
"If you're using native standard JS functions (`start()`, `willStart()`, "
"`cleanForSave()`, etc), make sure you call `this._super.apply(this, "
"arguments)`; (Check if it's necessary in the standard code)."
msgstr ""
