#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/translations.rst:124
msgid ""
"Translating pages directly from the backend allows you to translate several "
"languages at the same time. To do so, go to :menuselection:`Settings --> "
"Technical --> User Interface: Views`, search for the name of the page you "
"want to translate, and click the :guilabel:`Edit Translations` button."
msgstr ""
"Превеждането на страници директно от backend-а ви позволява да превеждате на"
