#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/translations.rst:137
msgid ""
"Once you are done translating, you need to export the translations to "
"integrate them into your module. To export everything at once, open your "
"database, activate :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>`, and go to "
":menuselection:`Settings --> Translations --> Export Translation`. Select "
"the :guilabel:`Language` you translated, *PO File* under :guilabel:`File "
"Format`, and *website_airproof* as the :guilabel:`Apps To Export`."
msgstr ""
"След като приключите с превода, трябва да експортирате преводите, за да ги "
"интегрирате в модула си. За да експортирате всичко наведнъж, отворете базата"
" си данни, активирайте :ref:`режим за разработчици <developer-mode>` и "
"отидете на :menuselection:`Settings --> Translations --> Export "
"Translation`. Изберете :guilabel:`Language`, на който сте превеждали, *PO "
"File* под :guilabel:`File Format`, и *website_airproof* като :guilabel:`Apps"
" To Export`."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/translations.rst:143
msgid ""
"Download the file and move it to the :file:`i18n` folder. If needed, you can"
" manually edit the :file:`.po` file afterward."
