#: ../../docs/content/developer/howtos/website_themes/translations.rst:151
msgid ""
"You can translate directly by editing a :file:`.po` file or creating the "
"file yourself. Check out the :doc:`translating modules documentation "
"<../translations>` to write your translations."
msgstr ""
