#: ../../docs/content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:994
msgid "The behaviour of the mixin adapts to your model:"
msgstr "Поведението на mixin-а се адаптира към вашия модел:"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:996
msgid ""
"The ``rating.rating`` record will be linked to the ``partner_id`` field of "
"your model (if the field is present)."
msgstr ""
"Записът ``rating.rating`` ще бъде свързан с полето ``partner_id`` на вашия "
"модел (ако полето присъства)."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:999
msgid ""
"this behaviour can be overridden with the function "
"``rating_get_partner_id()`` if you use another field than ``partner_id``"
msgstr ""
"това поведение може да бъде override-нато с функцията "
"``rating_get_partner_id()``, ако използвате друго поле вместо ``partner_id``"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:1002
msgid ""
"The ``rating.rating`` record will be linked to the partner of the "
"``user_id`` field of your model (if the field is present) (i.e. the partner "
