msgid "This is equivalent to"
msgstr "Това е еквивалентно на"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:224
msgid ""
"if the name of the test is unambiguous. Multiple modules, classes and "
"functions can be specified at once separated by a `,` like with regular "
