#: ../../docs/content/developer/reference/frontend/assets.rst:315
msgid "The asset model (`ir.asset`)"
msgstr "Моделът за assets (`ir.asset`)"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/reference/frontend/assets.rst:317
msgid ""
"In most cases the assets declared in the manifest will largely suffice. Yet "
"for more flexibility, the framework also supports dynamic assets declared in"
" the database."
