"<https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/v2/doc/reference/hooks.md#useref>`_."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/reference/frontend/hooks.rst:219
msgid "the target HTMLElement to be positioned from"
msgstr "целевият HTMLElement, спрямо който да се позиционира"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/reference/frontend/hooks.rst:221
msgid "the positioning options (see table below)"
msgstr "опциите за позициониране (вижте таблицата по-долу)"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/reference/frontend/hooks.rst:230
msgid "`popper`"
msgstr "`popper`"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/reference/frontend/hooks.rst:232
msgid ""
"this is a `useRef reference "
"<https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/hooks.md#useref>`_"
" for the element that will get positioned. Default is `\"popper\"`."
msgstr ""
"това е `useRef референция "
"<https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/hooks.md#useref>`_"
" за елемента, който ще бъде позициониран. По подразбиране е `\"popper\"`."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/reference/frontend/hooks.rst:234
msgid "`container`"
msgstr "`container`"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/reference/frontend/hooks.rst:235
msgid "HTMLElement"
msgstr "HTMLElement"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/reference/frontend/hooks.rst:236
msgid ""
"the container from which the popper is expected not to overflow. If "
"overflowing occurs, other popper positions are tried until a not overflowing"
" one is found. (default: the `<html/>` node)"
msgstr ""
"контейнерът, извън който се очаква popper-ът да не преминава (overflow). Ако"
" възникне преминаване извън контейнера, се изпробват други позиции на "
"popper-а, докато се намери такава без преминаване. (по подразбиране: възелът"
" `<html/>`)"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/reference/frontend/hooks.rst:239
msgid "`margin`"
msgstr "`margin`"

