"`mountView`, която приема обект с параметри, определящи `type` на изгледа, "
"`resModel`, и други опционални свойства като XML `arch`:"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/web_helpers.rst:123
msgid ""
"Like the previous helpers on top of which `mountView` is built, it will "
"ensure that both an `env` and a `MockServer` are running for the current "
