"`oe_inline`: prevents the usual line break following fields, and limits "
"their span;"
msgstr ""
"`oe_inline`: предотвратява обичайния пренос на ред след полетата и "
"ограничава тяхната ширина;"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/generic_attribute_class.rst:10
#: ../../docs/content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/generic_attribute_class.rst:10
