"`oe_left`, `oe_right`: `floats <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-"
"US/docs/Web/CSS/float>`_ the element to the corresponding direction;"
msgstr ""
"`oe_left`, `oe_right`: `плаващо разположение "
"<https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/float>`_ на елемента в "
"съответната посока;"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/generic_attribute_class.rst:12
#: ../../docs/content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/generic_attribute_class.rst:12
#: ../../docs/content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/generic_attribute_class.rst:12
