#: ../../docs/content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/generic_attribute_class.rst:12
msgid ""
"`oe_read_only`, `oe_edit_only`: only displays the element in the "
"corresponding form mode;"
msgstr ""
"`oe_read_only`, `oe_edit_only`: показва елемента само в съответния режим на "
"формата;"

#: ../../docs/content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/generic_attribute_class.rst:13
#: ../../docs/content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/generic_attribute_class.rst:13
#: ../../docs/content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/generic_attribute_class.rst:13
