msgid "Add an input above the task list with placeholder *Enter a new task*."
msgstr ""
"Добавете input над списъка със задачи с placeholder *Enter a new task*."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:311
msgid ""
"Add an `event handler "
