#: ../../docs/content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:43
msgid ""
"Most screens in the Odoo web client uses a common layout: a control panel on"
" top, with some buttons, and a main content zone just below. This is done "
"using the `Layout component "
"<https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/18.0/addons/web/static/src/search/layout.js>`_,"
" available in `@web/search/layout`."
msgstr ""
"Повечето екрани в уеб клиента на Odoo използват общ layout: контролен панел "
"отгоре, с няколко бутона, и основна зона за съдържание точно под него. Това "
"се реализира чрез `компонента Layout "
"<https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/18.0/addons/web/static/src/search/layout.js>`_,"
" наличен в `@web/search/layout`."

#: ../../docs/content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:47
