#: ../../docs/content/developer/tutorials/importable_modules.rst:429
msgid ""
"A one-to-many is a relation to a list of objects. In our example, we will "
"define a one-to-many relation towards a new ``x_estate.property.offer`` "
"model. This offer represent an offer made by a customer to buy a property."
