"<https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/713dd3777ca0ce9d121d5162a3d63de3237509f4/addons/account/models/account_reconcile_model.py#L248-L251>`__."
msgstr ""
"Примерът е даден с :class:`~odoo.fields.Many2one`, но е валиден и за "
